<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-GERMAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GERMAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of German Bundesliga matches played on Friday:</p>
<p>Karlsruhe 5 (Dundee 28th minute, 50th, 68th, Keller 43rd, Schroth 59th) Arminia Bielefeld 2 (Kuntz 79th, Gerber 82nd).</p>
<p>Halftime 2-0. Attendance 21,000 Cologne 2 (Vladoiu 55th, Oliseh 76th penalty) Bochum 0. 0-0. 23,000</p>
